<p dir="auto">Firefox 145 adds support for the <code class="notranslate">position-area</code> property: see <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1924086" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1924086</a>. From testing, it appears to be only enabled in nightly builds.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds an entry for <code class="notranslate">position-area</code> to the Firefox Experimental features page.</p>

